Package: air
Type: Package
Title: AI for R — Live AI Assistance in RStudio
Version: 0.4.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Mahesh", "Solanki", email = "maheshsinh1910@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0000-0000-0000")))
Description: Bring AI-powered coding assistance directly into your R workflow.
    Chat with AI models, get code explanations, debug errors, generate documentation,
    and create R code from natural language — all without leaving RStudio.
    Supports OpenAI (GPT-4o, GPT-3.5), Ollama (Llama, Mistral, locally),
    Anthropic Claude, DeepSeek, Kimi, and Z.Ai backends.
